1.Chuc nang them benh nhan 

Buoc 1 
người sử dụng click chuột vào nut"Them benh nhan mơi"
trên form " Quản lý bệnh nhân" ==> hệ thống tạo ra biến "controller" có giá trị là "addPatient"
/// <a href ="controller=addPatient" class = "btn btn-success" >Them benh nhan moi</a> 

Bước 2
Routing kiem tra Neu gia tri bien "controller" la "addPatient" thi goi phuong thuc "add()" cua "patientController"
if ($controller=='addPatient'){$patientController->add();}
Buoc 3
Phuong thuc "add()" cua "patientController" thuc hien show giao dien from "Them benh nhan"
public function add()
{
    include_once APP_ROOT.'/app/views/patient/add.php';
}
Buoc 4
Nguoi su dung nhap thong tin benh nhan
Buoc5
Nguoi su dung an nut "Them" => Tao bien POST[btn_create](form them co phuong thuc POST)
<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"name="btn create">Them</button>

Buoc 6
Routing kiem tra Neu gia tri bien POST[btn_create] duoc thiep lap thi goi phuowng thuc "store()" cua "patientController"

Buoc 7
public function store(){
    $name= $_POST['name'];
    $gender = $_POST['gender'];
    $patient = $_POST ['patient'];
    $patientService = new patientService();
    $patientService->addPatient($patient);

    header('Location: ?controller = home');
}
Buoc 8
ham "addPatient" cua doi tuong "patientService" thuc hien insert ban ghi moi vao CSDL

public function addPatient(patient $patient){
    $dbConnection = new DBConnection();
    if ($dbConnection != null){
        $conn = $dbConnection->getConnection();
        if($conn !=null){
            $name = $patient->getFullName();
            $gender = $patient->getGender();
            $sql = "INSERT INTO patients (name, gender) VALUES ('$name','$gender')";
            $conn ->exec($sql);
        }
    }

}

